#: Views/DebugSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.DebugSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Wrap rendered shapes in HTML comments to help identify the template or "
"binding that produced each fragment."
msgstr "使用 HTML 注释包裹渲染后的形状，以帮助识别生成每个片段的模板或绑定。"

#: Views/DebugSettings.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.DebugSettings.Edit"
msgid "Write shape debug information"
msgstr "写入形状调试信息"

#: Views/Settings-Cache.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Cache.Edit"
msgid "Cache Mode"
msgstr "缓存模式"

#: Views/Settings-Cache.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Cache.Edit"
msgid "Determines whether caches are enabled or disabled."
msgstr "确定缓存是启用还是禁用。"

#: Views/Settings-Cache.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Cache.Edit"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

#: Views/Settings-Cache.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Cache.Edit"
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

#: Views/Settings-Cache.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Cache.Edit"
msgid "Enabled with cache debug mode"
msgstr "已启用缓存调试模式"

#: Views/Settings-Cache.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Cache.Edit"
msgid "From environment — enabled in Production, disabled otherwise"
msgstr "根据环境 — 生产环境中启用，其他环境中禁用"

#: Views/Settings-Cache.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Cache.Edit"
msgid "Settings for dynamic caches"
msgstr "动态缓存设置"

#: Views/Settings-Reload.Wrapper.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Reload.Wrapper"
msgid ""
"The website might be restarted upon saving the settings, potentially leading"
" to temporary unresponsiveness during the process."
msgstr "保存设置时，网站可能会重启，因此此过程中可能会暂时无响应。"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid ""
"A base CDN URL prefixed to the local scripts and stylesheets. It is disabled"
" if the value is empty or if the Resource Debug Mode is enabled, e.g. "
"<em>https://cdn.mysite.com</em>"
msgstr ""
"用于本地脚本和样式表的基础 CDN URL。值为空或启用资源调试模式时将禁用该功能，例如 <em>https://cdn.mysite.com</em>"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid ""
"Determines whether scripts and stylesheets load in their debuggable or "
"minified form."
msgstr "确定脚本和样式表以可调试形式还是压缩形式加载。"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "Disabled — use minified version of resources"
msgstr "已禁用 — 使用资源的压缩版本"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "Enabled — use debuggable version of resources"
msgstr "已启用 — 使用资源的可调试版本"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "From environment — disabled in Production, enabled otherwise"
msgstr "根据环境 — 生产环境中禁用，其他环境中启用"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "Resource Debug Mode"
msgstr "资源调试模式"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "Settings for scripts and stylesheets"
msgstr "脚本和样式表设置"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "Site CDN (Content Delivery Network) base url"
msgstr "站点 CDN（内容分发网络）基础 URL"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "Use framework CDN (Content Delivery Network)"
msgstr "使用框架 CDN（内容分发网络）"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid "Use resources cache busting"
msgstr "启用资源缓存失效"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid ""
"Whether a framework CDN is used for registered scripts and stylesheets, such"
" as jQuery, or their local version"
msgstr "确定是否对已注册的脚本和样式表（例如 jQuery）使用框架 CDN，还是使用其本地版本"

#: Views/Settings-Resources.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Resources.Edit"
msgid ""
"Whether cache busting (append a version) is used for scripts and stylesheets"
msgstr "确定是否通过附加版本号来避免脚本和样式表使用缓存"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of the page size values users can select from, for "
"example 10, 25, 50, 100."
msgstr "供用户选择的每页显示数量，以逗号分隔，例如 10, 25, 50, 100。"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Allow users to change the page size on listing pages"
msgstr "允许用户在列表页面更改每页显示数量"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Base url"
msgstr "基础 URL"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Default Time Zone"
msgstr "默认时区"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid ""
"Determines the default time zone used when displaying and editing dates and "
"times. DST (daylight saving time) will be applied automatically per time "
"zone if available."
msgstr "确定显示和编辑日期及时间时使用的默认时区。如果可用，将自动按时区应用夏令时（DST，daylight saving time）。"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Enter the fully qualified base URL of the web site."
msgstr "请输入网站的完整限定基础 URL。"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Local to server"
msgstr "服务器本地时区"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Page size"
msgstr "每页显示数量"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Page size options"
msgstr "每页显示数量选项"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Page size selection"
msgstr "每页显示数量选择"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Page title format"
msgstr "页面标题格式"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Site name"
msgstr "站点名称"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "The default format of page titles."
msgstr "页面标题的默认格式。"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "The default page size."
msgstr "默认每页显示数量。"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "The site name."
msgstr "站点名称。"

#. Format arguments: {0}: Model.MaxPageSize
#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
#, csharp-format
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid "Values cannot exceed the maximum page size of {0}."
msgstr "值不能超过最大每页显示数量 {0}。"

#: Views/Settings-Site.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Settings.Views.Settings-Site.Edit"
msgid ""
"When enabled, a selector is shown on listing pages so users can choose how "
"many items are displayed per page."
msgstr "启用后，列表页面会显示选择器，用户可据此选择每页显示的内容数量。"
